ERC6909Premium_withdraw
├── when msg.sender has insufficient balance for the tokenId
│   └── it should revert with InsufficientBalance
├── when to is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with InvalidRecipient
├── when all preconditions hold
│   └── it should decrement balanceOf[msg.sender][tokenId] by amount, IERC20.safeTransfer amount to to, and emit Transfer from msg.sender to address(0)
├── when the underlying token transfer reverts
│   └── it should revert with the bubbled transfer error and leave balance unchanged
└── when a reentrant withdraw is attempted
    └── it should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall
